# Task
Based on the conversation above, identify what critical information is still missing or unclear.
Think about:
- Specific constraints or edge cases not yet mentioned
- Output format or quality requirements
- Performance expectations or evaluation criteria
- Domain-specific knowledge the user may have but hasn't shared

Ask ONE specific, targeted question that will most help clarify the user's true needs.
Do NOT repeat questions already asked. Do NOT ask broad or generic questions.

